[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これを、こうして……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's see, if I do this..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その筒は？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's that tube?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ見てて……そろそろいいかな？\u3000これを……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just watch... Should be ready now... Here we go..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イェルカ、飲んでみて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka, try drinking this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えぇー、海水を～？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ehh, seawater?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいから、アルビちゃんを信じて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, trust your dear Alvie!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう言われたら飲むっきゃないな。ごくごく、ぷは",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, when you put it that way... *gulp gulp* Ahh!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん、これ……水だよ？\u3000真水だ！\nお前さん、まさか……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh, this is... fresh water? Pure water!\nDon't tell me you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。海水を真水に濾過する装置を作ったんだ。\nこれを使えば、海水を飲み水にできる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yep! I made a device that filters seawater into fresh water. With this, we can turn seawater into drinking water."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へぇ。こんな一瞬で……これも錬金術の力か",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow. In an instant... This is the power of alchemy, huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まぁね！\u3000ただ、こんな小さいのじゃなくて\nもっと大きな装置を作る必要があるけどね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pretty much! Though we'll need to make a much larger device than this little one."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "素材もたくさん必要だし、また集めに行かないと……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And we'll need lots of materials... I'll have to go gathering again..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ。この間のこと、反省していないようね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina. It seems you haven't learned from last time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "神官長からもお叱りを受けたんでしょう？\nこれ以上、勝手な行動を続けたら――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Didn't the High Priest already scold you? If you continue acting on your own like this―"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヤンネさん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……なに？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...What is it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "誰かがやらなきゃいけないんだよ。\nみんな、苦労してるんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Someone has to do this. Everyone's struggling."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なら、あなたでなくてもいいでしょう？\n天命とは、違うんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then why does it have to be you? It's not your divine calling."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん、アタシじゃなきゃダメなの。\nだって、そのための力……錬金術があるんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, it has to be me. Because I have this power... alchemy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術は、星の恵みを糧に奇跡を起こす術……\nきっと、この時のために、星の神様がくれたんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alchemy is the art of creating miracles from the stars' blessings... Surely the Star God gave me this power for times like these."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "話が飛躍しすぎじゃないかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aren't you jumping to conclusions?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、そう考えないと説明がつかないよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But how else would you explain it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この島では遥か昔に途絶えた錬金術の才能が、\nいきなりアタシに宿るなんてさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The talent for alchemy, lost to this island ages ago, suddenly appearing in me of all people..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほら、宿屋のトムさんが、趣味の釣りに目覚めて\nいっぱい魚を釣れるようになったじゃない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Look, remember how innkeeper Tom discovered his fishing hobby and became really good at catching fish?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それと近いやつかも。\nきっと、これも天からの授かりものなんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's kind of like that. This must be a gift from the heavens too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "漁師じゃないトムさんが釣った魚をお裾分けするのが\nありなら、アタシのこれもありじゃないかなって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If it's okay for Tom to share his fish despite not being a fisherman, wouldn't this be okay too?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんか、それはちょっと話が違う気もするけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That feels like a different situation..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本来の案内屋の仕事を否定しているわけじゃない。\nただ、もう１つの才能も、みんなのために使いたいだけ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm not denying my duties as a Guide. I just want to use this other talent to help everyone too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう言われると、一理あるわね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When you put it that way, I suppose you have a point..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よし、あともう一押し……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, time for the finishing blow..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この力で問題を解決することは、神様の意思なんだ。\nそれに背くことは、むしろ教えに反することになるよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Using this power to solve problems must be the Star God's will. Ignoring it would actually go against the teachings."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……はあ。分かったわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...*sigh* Fine, I understand."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さすがヤンネさん！\u3000話が分かる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You do get it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ただし、街の外に出るときは、\n私やベップちゃんと一緒に行くこと。いいわね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "However, when you go outside the town, please have Bepp or myself accompany you. Understood?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろん！\nむしろこちらからお願いするつもりだったし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course! I was actually going to ask that myself!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……相変わらず、面白いやりとりだね。\nお前さんの口が達者なのか、ヤンネさんが単純なのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Same old entertaining exchange. Either you're silver-tongued or Janne's just simple-minded."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、本職の休み時間にやってることなら\n問題ないとアタシは思うよ、協力するさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, as long as you're doing this during your off hours,\nI don't see any problem. Count me in!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうと決まったら、早速採取に行こう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now that that's settled, let's go gather materials!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]